OL,3,GNEWSAAnglo-Saxon treasure blocked from
OL,4,Aleaving UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn "exceptionally rare" Anglo-Saxon
OL,7,Fornament more than 1,400 years old has
OL,8,Fbeen blocked from leaving the UK by the
OL,9,Fgovernment.
OL,11,FThe metal mount, depicting a
OL,12,Ffour-legged animal, was discovered by a
OL,13,Fmetal detectorist in Holme Hale, near
OL,14,FSwaffham, Norfolk, in 2024.
OL,16,FThe temporary ban prevents it from
OL,17,Fleaving the UK permanently, allowing
OL,18,Forganisations, such as Norwich's Castle
OL,19,FMuseum, the chance to acquire it so it
OL,20,Fcan remain a national treasure.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
