OL,3,GNEWSAAnglo-Saxon treasure blocked from
OL,4,Aleaving UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FArt minister Ruth Mackenzie said
OL,7,Fkeeping the object in the UK would
OL,8,Foffer researchers an "important window
OL,9,Finto our Anglo-Saxon past".
